    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Missed call text-back (Twilio): never lose a caller\nCalls to your Twilio number ring your phone. If you don't answer, the caller instantly gets a friendly text, the call is logged and you get an email.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e078620d-46ba-54fb-8052-5b72f46f6f17",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Open **Settings** and **Settings for texts** (keep them the same): your phone, Twilio number, email, sheet URL. Make a sheet tab **Missed calls** with the headers in `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Activate the workflow. Copy the production URL of **Call finished** into `dial_result_url` in **Settings**.\n3. In Twilio, set your number's *A call comes in* webhook (POST) to the production URL of **Incoming call**.\n4. Connect Twilio, Google Sheets and Gmail. Call your Twilio number and don't answer to test.\n5. US numbers: texting needs A2P 10DLC registration in Twilio first.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b6cce1d5-e00f-5fee-a995-8fc8d8fa9486",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -460
      ]
    }
